cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article and this repository."
title: "Counting on register: code and data"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a study of numeral distribution as a predictor of text register in
  Slovenian: a KonText extraction script and per-document numeral counts for Gigafida 2.1,
  feature extraction for the SSJ Universal Dependencies treebank, and the classification,
  evaluation and feature-importance pipeline.
type: software
authors:
